  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 82ed9010a4ceca24db0d85afdec1f4e6, type: 3}
  m_Name: TanfanaMainStory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryNode
  storyPart: "Little is known of Tanfana, an ancient deity once worshipped in the
    lands of Twente. \r\n\r\nLegends tell of a sacred place upon the Tankenberg where
    her followers gathered beside a great stone and a holy spring. During their ceremonies,
    they drank sacred water from a golden cup said to grant wisdom and visions. \r\n\r\nThe
    Romans are said to have destroyed her sanctuary during a great festival and over
    time her worship faded from memory. Yet stories of Tanfana endured. \r\n\r\nEven
    now, travelers speak of a pale woman wandering the mist-covered hills. Whether
    she is a goddess, a spirit or merely a legend, no one can say. \r\n\r\nThose
    who seek the truth may find that the old stories are not as forgotten as they
    seem. "
